    "text": "{\"projectId\":\"8978791379095391159\",\"sessionId\":\"4832612516137849153\",\"outputComponents\":[{\"designSystem\":{\"name\":\"assets/aef5362842b249d59480b9bb7c0d9d1b\",\"designSystem\":{\"displayName\":\"Luminous Pure Glass\",\"styleGuidelines\":\"## Brand & Style\\n\\nThis design system expresses the discipline and clarity of an elite financial interface through an ultra-refined \\\"iOS 26\\\" optical glass aesthetic. Designed specifically for full-screen immersive chart environments, it strips away opaque containers, harsh divider lines, and visual friction in favor of crystalline floating surfaces.\\n\\nThe emotional tone is calm, precise, and authoritative. It combines pristine light-mode minimalism with advanced optical glassmorphism:\\n- **Optical Float:** Interactive components hover effortlessly above continuous data visualizations without breaking analytical focus.\\n- **Specular Precision:** Surfaces evoke chemically strengthened glass with micro-highlight rim lighting and deep Gaussian refraction.\\n- **Data First:** The full-canvas candlestick chart serves as the live substrate; controls and readouts feel like weightless precision instruments resting on an illuminated optical plate.\\n\\n## Layout & Spacing\\n\\nEngineered specifically around the target 402x874pt iOS mobile viewport:\\n\\n- **Viewport Architecture:** Full-bleed background layer dedicated to interactive chart graphics. Content floats above with safe areas reserved for dynamic island (`54pt` top) and home indicator (`34pt` bottom).\\n- **Horizontal Margins:** Fixed `16px` (`margin`) screen edges to anchor floating pill docks, action buttons, and sheet panels.\\n- **Component Flow:** Vertical rhythm follows micro-increments (4px / 8px / 12px) to maximize available canvas real estate for multi-timeframe charts.\\n- **Dock & Island Elevation:** Floating trading triggers and time-interval selectors maintain `12px` clearance from edge boundaries, ensuring gesture safety without blocking underlying data trends.\\n\\n## Elevation & Depth\\n\\nVisual hierarchy uses physical optical dispersion rather than drop shadows or opaque borders:\\n\\n- **Surface Glass Recipe:** Base layer `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72)` supported by high-radius blur filter `backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(190%)`.\\n- **Specular Rim Rim Lighting:** Instead of boundary strokes, surfaces implement an inset rim glow: `box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95), inset 0 -0.5px 0.5px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3)`.\\n- **Luminous Soft Shadows:** Diffusion without gray dirtiness. Shadows are ultra-diffuse and tinted by ambient light: `box-shadow: 0 12px 32px -4px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.06), 0 4px 16px -2px rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.04)`.\\n- **Layer Stacking Hierarchy:**\\n  - *Tier 0 (Substrate):* Clean white canvas with interactive candle/vector series (`#FFFFFF` background).\\n  - *Tier 1 (Surface Glass):* Floating intervals, toolbar pill indicators, and instrument chips (`0.72` opacity).\\n  - *Tier 2 (Interactive Floating Docks):* Execution dock and quick-trade panels with active specular reflection (`0.82` opacity).\\n  - *Tier 3 (Modals & Precision Sheets):* Deep blur frosted overlays with intensified top highlight rings (`0.88` opacity).\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Floating Docks & Navigation\\n- **Trading Dock:** Anchored `16px` above the bottom safe area. Encased in an ultra-pure glass pill housing Buy/Sell action triggers and lot-size steppers.\\n- **Timeframe Selector:** Floating horizontal pill centered at the top sub-header. Active interval displays in `#0A84FF` with a soft white glow capsule underneath; inactive tabs use `#6B7280`.\\n\\n### Action Buttons\\n- **Primary Execution (Long):** Gradient-free high-luminance Emerald Jade (`#169873`) with white typographic ink, soft specular rim, and jade halo shadow (`0 8px 24px -2px rgba(22, 152, 115, 0.35)`).\\n- **Primary Execution (Short):** Intense 
